   ],
   "spoken": "The bishop to f5 comes out before e6 could ever trap it — the whole point of Black's Advance play. Unlike the French, the light-squared bishop is active, outside the pawn chain.",
   "kind": "main",
   "teaches": "In the Advance Caro, get the bishop to f5 before e6; that free bishop is Black's edge over the French.",
   "plans": "Play e6, then hit d4 with c5 and the pieces."
